Your Majesty,

Where Rome will not give, England may take. I enclose privileged advice setti=
ng out the lawful path: an Act restraining appeals, and recognition of Your M=
ajesty as Supreme Head of the Church in England.

The Archbishop may then determine the Great Matter here at home. I commend th=
e enclosed to Your Majesty's careful and private reading.

Your servant,
Thomas Cromwell

